{
 "duration": 181.32,
 "lead": 0.25,
 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Arlo opened his card statement and counted eleven things he never remembered buying.",
   "emote": "surprise",
   "start": 0.25,
   "end": 4.89
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Each one was small. None was over sixteen dollars.",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 5.19,
   "end": 9.14
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "jo",
   "speaker": "Jo",
   "text": "Read them out loud.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 9.59,
   "end": 10.72
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "A film app. A music app. Cloud space. A meal box. I ate that once.",
   "emote": "worry",
   "start": 11.17,
   "end": 17.19
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "By the end of this evening, he would know the one number he had never seen.",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 17.64,
   "end": 22.45
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "It started on a Tuesday. A film app offered seven days free.",
   "emote": "happy",
   "start": 23.3,
   "end": 27.05
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "Free? Sure. I'll cancel before it renews.",
   "emote": "happy",
   "start": 27.5,
   "end": 30.6
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "He did not cancel. After the free week it cost five dollars a month, charged on the same day, every month.",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 31.05,
   "end": 37.51
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Nothing felt different. Money left his account, and he felt nothing at all.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 37.81,
   "end": 42.46
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Then a Friday. His phone said the storage was full.",
   "emote": "worry",
   "start": 43.31,
   "end": 46.9
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "Twelve dollars for more space? Fine. It's just space.",
   "emote": "tired",
   "start": 47.35,
   "end": 51.63
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "It was easy. One tap, and the problem went away.",
   "emote": "relief",
   "start": 52.08,
   "end": 56.37
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "A music app came the same way. A meal box came after a long week.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 56.67,
   "end": 61.41
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Each yes took less than ten seconds, on a different evening.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 61.71,
   "end": 65.35
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "The meal box was a Sunday. Four dinners a week, and the first box was half price.",
   "emote": "happy",
   "start": 66.2,
   "end": 71.28
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "Half price? I'll pause it after the first one.",
   "emote": "happy",
   "start": 71.73,
   "end": 74.42
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "He forgot to pause it. The box renewed on the same date every month, and most months he was out of town.",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 74.87,
   "end": 81.09
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "jo",
   "speaker": "Jo",
   "text": "Out of town, and still paying for dinners.",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 81.54,
   "end": 84.02
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "That is how an eleventh charge arrives. Not in one big yes. In ten small ones, and a forgotten pause.",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 84.47,
   "end": 92.36
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Researchers who study spending have a name for what he did not feel. The pain of paying.",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 93.21,
   "end": 98.77
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Handing over cash stings. A card tap stings less. A charge that repeats on its own barely registers.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 99.07,
   "end": 106.57
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "It does not mean people are foolish. It describes how the sting fades when payment is automatic and small.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 106.87,
   "end": 113.46
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Back on the couch, Jo helped him add the lines.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 114.31,
   "end": 117.3
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "jo",
   "speaker": "Jo",
   "text": "Five. Fourteen. Twenty-six. Keep going.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 117.75,
   "end": 121.8
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Ninety-one dollars. Every month.",
   "emote": "shock",
   "start": 122.25,
   "end": 124.68
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "Ninety-one? I never spent ninety-one on anything.",
   "emote": "shock",
   "start": 125.13,
   "end": 128.19
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "i": 4,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Twelve months of it was one thousand, ninety-two dollars.",
   "emote": "shock",
   "start": 128.64,
   "end": 132.14
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "jo",
   "speaker": "Jo",
   "text": "Which ones did you use this month?",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 132.99,
   "end": 134.77
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "The music app. The cloud space. Maybe the film app. Once.",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 135.22,
   "end": 140.04
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Three of the eleven. The other eight had been paid for months, each one quietly.",
   "emote": "sad",
   "start": 140.49,
   "end": 145.69
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 3,
   "who": "jo",
   "speaker": "Jo",
   "text": "If someone asked for ninety-one dollars at once, would you have said yes?",
   "emote": "doubt",
   "start": 146.14,
   "end": 150.55
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 4,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "No. Not in one go. Never.",
   "emote": "sad",
   "start": 151.0,
   "end": 153.83
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 5,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "That is the trick of small. Nothing was hidden. It was only spread across eleven dates.",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 154.28,
   "end": 160.14
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 6,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "He crossed out five that night, and left the rest on his list to think about.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 160.44,
   "end": 164.14
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "i": 7,
   "who": "arlo",
   "speaker": "Arlo",
   "text": "It's strange. The charges were never big. It was the adding that hurt.",
   "emote": "sad",
   "start": 164.59,
   "end": 169.61
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "i": 0,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "No single charge ever felt like a decision. Together, they were a year of them.",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 170.46,
   "end": 176.04
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "i": 1,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Arlo kept the printed list on the fridge.",
   "emote": "calm",
   "start": 176.34,
   "end": 178.59
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "i": 2,
   "who": "narrator",
   "speaker": "Narrator",
   "text": "Which of the eleven would you have kept?",
   "emote": "think",
   "start": 178.89,
   "end": 180.72
  }
 ],
